| Bernoulli dropout, p = 0.2 | 23.6738 ± 0.0122 | 23.6699 | 0.3 |
| Gaussian dropout, p = 0.2 | 23.6484 ± 0.0148 | 23.6699 | -1.4 |
| Bernoulli dropout, p = 0.5 | 28.9659 ± 0.0295 | 29.0029 | -1.3 |
| Gaussian dropout, p = 0.5 | 29.0322 ± 0.0317 | 29.0029 | 0.9 |

