Least squares (p = 0): (0.960, -0.974, 1.958, 0.519, 0.293); true β = (1.000, -1.000, 2.000, 0.500, 0.300).
no dropout: pre-activation variance at layers 1, 8, 16, 32 = 1.007, 0.946, 0.955, 0.949; mean-field 1.000, 1.000, 1.000, 1.000.
dropout: pre-activation variance at layers 1, 8, 16, 32 = 1.007, 1.428, 1.539, 1.595; mean-field 1.000, 1.488, 1.605, 1.625.
alpha dropout: pre-activation variance at layers 1, 8, 16, 32 = 1.007, 0.982, 0.977, 0.996; mean-field 1.000, 1.000, 1.000, 1.000.

